i><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>29</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Method II<br /><math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Multiply with <math><mi>M</mi></math> both side<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>I</mi></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ...(i)<br />Equation (i) represents characteristic equation of matrix <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math><br />Hence, Trace <math><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math><br />Sum of roots of characteristic equation <math><mo>=</mo></math> Trace of matrix<br />Product of roots of characteristic equation <math><mo>=</mo></math> determined of matrix<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><math><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now proceed as Method 1",
